    "course_pol": "手機靜音，僅限課堂用途。課堂期間不得使用社交媒體。保持課堂專注，不得閒聊。保持教室整潔，勿亂丟垃圾。禁止在課堂吃食物。請勿在課堂打瞌睡。遵守考試規定，不得相互交流答案。",
    "course_pol_en": "Silence your cell phone, for classroom use only. Social media usage is not allowed during class. Maintain focus during the course, refraining from chatting. Keep the classroom tidy; do not litter. Eating in the classroom is prohibited. Please avoid dozing off during class. Adhere to exam regulations, refraining from exchanging answers with others.",
    "course_rem": null,
    "course_rem_en": null,
    "ais_meno": "<div>提交的所有學術作業和報告必須是原創的，引用他人資料必須正確標註來源。</div>\n\n<div>鼓勵學術討論，但要保持獨立思考和尊重不同觀點。</div>\n\n<div>在合作研究中，需明確說明各自貢獻，並尊重共同作者。</div>\n\n<div>在考試中，不得幫助他人作弊或接受他人幫助。</div>\n",
    "ais_meno_en": "<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>All submitted academic assignments and reports must be original. When referencing others&#39; materials, proper source attribution is required. Academic discussions are encouraged, but maintaining independent thinking and respecting different viewpoints is essential. In collaborative research, individual contributions must be clearly stated, and respect for co-authors is expected. During exams, aiding others in cheating or accepting assistance from others is prohibited.&quot;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div>\n<div>\n<div><br />\n<gwmw style=\"display:none;\"></gwmw></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n",
    "ilearn_mk": "N"
  },
